This product bundles files from the dsh-in-hand project
(https://github.com/dingchenhui0618-arch/dsh-in-hand, Apache-2.0):

  public/page.html               the phone-side page shell
  public/sw.js                   the service worker
  public/manifest.webmanifest    the PWA manifest
  public/icon-192.png            app icon
  public/icon-512.png            app icon

Those files are the relay's user interface. They are redistributed here
unmodified so that this relay is usable on its own; a copy of the Apache-2.0
license text is at https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The relay itself (server.mjs, lan.ps1, its built-in fallback page, and
everything under docs/) is original work under the MIT license above.
